  "content_id": "16136234",
  "title": "Polkadot DOT Network Fees",
  "description": "Polkadot (DOT) Network – Scalable and Predictable\nPolkadot is designed for interoperability and scalability, with a predictable fee struct...",
  "body": "<h1 id=\"h_01JSZ2M7H85K4WQ8HK6PATKGJT\">Polkadot (DOT) Network – Scalable and Predictable</h1><p class=\"no-margin\">Polkadot is designed for interoperability and scalability, with a predictable fee structure to keep costs stable even during network congestion.</p><h2 id=\"h_01JSZ2M7H8HFKYASA74W1SFBY7\">How DOT Fees Work</h2><p class=\"no-margin\">Fees are based on:</p><ul><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Transaction complexity</b></p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Network congestion (slight adjustment)</b><br>Fees are paid in <b>DOT tokens</b>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"no-margin\">Edge dynamically calculates the right fee for your DOT transactions based on real-time network conditions.</p><hr><h2 id=\"h_01JSZ2M7H8XEX1241Q722SYVGG\">Fee Options Available</h2><ul><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>High</b> – Fastest inclusion</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Optimal (default)</b> – Smart balance</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Low</b> – Cheapest, slower confirmation</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Custom</b> – Set your own fee if preferred</p></li></ul><hr><h2 id=\"h_01JSZ2M7H8X187CEC9H7VHGGME\">Average Cost</h2><p class=\"no-margin\">Sending DOT usually costs <b>$0.03 to $0.10 USD</b> depending on network activity.</p><hr><h2 id=\"h_01JSZ2M7H8XPBSZES924E0YHDA\">Why It Matters</h2><p class=\"no-margin\">DOT is built to remain affordable even during busy periods. Edge Wallet keeps it simple by suggesting the right fee based on speed or savings.</p>",
